Z||000004||fropuff||08-31-2000||11:30 PM||||I know this is my personal opinion, and I don't know if you will want to hear it.  But, I think it's the ugliest thing on a Fiero.  Well, not the ugliest, but pretty close.  It might look better on an aero nose, that pointed nose and HUGE scoop look terrible.  I don't know if that is a joke, but I hope you don't feel bad at my comments.  Sorry to say.||||reg||1
