Z||000014||StuGood||09-04-2000||02:41 AM||||Sorry, the Camaro scoop just doesn't do anything for me.  But if you do it, it sounds like you'll have a very unique Fiero.<P>For some reason, I <B>like</B> the twin rear-facing scoops (vents) idea.  They look very slick to me, as well as functional. <P>At least your Camaro scoop is symmetric. Please, whatever you do, just don't mount a scoop off on one side, like those timing belt lumps.  Always disliked those, for some reason. ||||reg||13
